Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Permanently tells Google Chrome on THIS device to treat
; http://10.100.1.40:3000 as a secure origin, so the microphone
; (voice recording) works no matter how the page is opened —
; typed address, shortcut, or a kiosk launcher script.
;
; Run this file, click through the "Add to registry?" prompt
; (admin rights required), then FULLY close every Chrome window/
; process before reopening — the policy is only read at browser
; startup.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\OverrideSecurityRestrictionsOnInsecureOrigin]
"1"="http://10.100.1.40:3000"
